# CH12 — Crown of Cinders. Rook (B10), SC08, the escape, and the atomic catastrophe transaction.

@scene CH12_DAIS once
music silence
show rook 15 7 down rook
say rook | You came. Good. I wanted witnesses who had read the vault.
say dain | We read it. It said the separation rite was taken away. Not that you get to hand it back to everyone at once.
say rook | A century of extraction, and you want to repair it one volunteer at a time.
say tessa | One volunteer at a time is how you know they're volunteers.
say rook | And the ones who die waiting? Do they get a hearing?
say oriel | They get asked. That is what you are skipping.
say rook | Then I will be the one who didn't ask. Someone has to.
say narr | Three relay lights kindle around the dais.
battle B10 noflee
set b10_done
music silence
say narr | Rook goes down on one knee. The dais controls spark and fail. The Golem pulls the last visible coupling.
say ivo | The visible relays are dark.
shake 0.5
sfx FX015
say tessa | Then why is it still climbing?
say dain | Rook.
say rook | I could not leave it to permission.
say oriel | Whose permission?
say rook | Any of yours.
say narr | Under the dais floor, lines the Golem never drew light one after another - the fourth relay, the pasted-over line from the archive diagram.
say ilyr | (Through Raven's throat, a command arrives that is not his own: overwrite the host.)
say ilyr | No.
say dain | Was that for him or for me?
say ilyr | For the command.
say oriel | The common channel - it's giving every node the same order. I can break it. Not stop it. Break it.
say ivo | The lifts still have power. Move.
say narr | Aurex sets both hands on the dais and pulls the channel apart. The order shatters into a thousand small voices. It does not stop.
music M027
flash #ffd8a0
shake 1.0
say rook | ...It was supposed to be freedom.
say sable | It was supposed to be asked.
say narr | Soldiers drag Rook toward the lift. Nobody lets go of him, and nobody leaves him behind.
objective dain | Escape! Reach the evacuation lift at the end of the collapsing aqueduct.
warp D09_ESC start up
@end

@scene CH12_ESC_TALK
say narr | Stone rains down in waves. Wait for the shaking to pass, then run.
@end

@scene CH12_FALL once
music silence
say narr | The lift cage slams shut. The Golem throws every lever he built into the cable brake.
say ivo | Holding - holding -
shake 1.2
flash #ffffff
fade out 1.2
say narr | The Conduit gives way beneath Veyr.
say narr | Coastlines fracture along old relay faults. Dormant dragon structures rise from the plains and the sea. The Crown's bell rings once, wrong, and every city hears it.
say narr | The lift cable snaps. The party scatters into the dark.
wait 1.0
phase post
music silence
say narr | ...
say narr | Salt water. A fire, somewhere. Someone humming badly.
warp T07_HEARTH wake down
fade in 1.5
call CH13_WAKE
@end
